 "description": "<p>A big-bell collar with matching chain, in pink, white, or black, with printed measurements: collar length 32-42 cm, chain length 77 cm. The cartoon-scale bell is the loudest design voice in the cute register.</p>\n<p>Sold in two combos - the full set or collars only. The printed cm figures make this one of the few collar listings where the fit question answers itself before ordering.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: leather</li>\n<li>Item type: collar with chain</li>\n<li>Style: cartoon big bell</li>\n<li>Color: pink, white, or black</li>\n<li>Fit: collar 32-42 cm, chain 77 cm</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Note the 32-42 cm collar range runs smaller than the category-standard 40-50. Check the printed figures.</p>\n",
